{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"668","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"日7-11飯糰包裝改採環保材質 成本增加、價格不變","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<table border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-spacing: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-bottom: 30px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\">\n\t<tbody style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">\n\t\t<tr style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none !important; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; min-height: 300px;\\\">\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/e3965233.jpg\\\" style=\\\"border: 0px; border-image: none; width: 800px; height: 600px; vertical-align: middle; box-sizing: border-box;\\\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">日本<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">7-11</span>。（圖／記者王曉敏攝）</span></p>\n\n<hr style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent);\\\" />\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">財經中心／綜合報導</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; outline: none !important;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none !important; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">近年環保意識抬頭，各大企業也都紛紛將環保意識融入營運當中，據日媒報導，日本的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">7-11</span>便利商店就決定要將飯糰的外包裝換成由植物塑膠製成的新包裝，藉此減少塑膠的使用量。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">據《日經中文網》報導，飯糰是日本<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">7-11</span>便利商店的熱賣商品，目前日本全境共有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">2.1</span>萬間門市，飯糰一年的銷售數量就達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">22.7</span>億個，與消暑飲料的銷售相當。面近年環保意識抬頭，日本<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">7-11</span>打算將年銷量如此龐大的飯糰換上新包裝，全新包裝將是「植物塑膠」材質，蔗糖為其主要原料之一，這也是日本便利商店界的首次嘗試。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">報導指出，日本<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">7-11</span>藉由這次的包裝大換血，預計一年可以減少二氧化碳排放量約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">403</span>噸，以及減少約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">260</span>噸的塑膠使用量。雖然採用植物塑膠的成本比過去採用一般塑膠來的高，但日本<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">7-11</span>表示，飯糰價格將不會做出調整。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">其實除了將飯糰換上更環保的包包裝外，日本企業近年來的確慢慢變得更環保，例如日本<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">7-11</span>在本月就在大阪的部分店面引進植物原料製成的湯匙和叉子；日清食品和全家也把部分容器換成了植物塑膠。日本<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">7-11</span>計畫，要逐步將自有品牌商品的塑膠容器更換為生物塑膠或可分解塑膠，預計<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">2030</span>年完成半數商品更換，到了<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">2050</span>年達成全部更換的目標。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">目前日本全境大約有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">5.8</span>萬間便利商店，各家廠商也都有在檢討自己的「塑膠政策」，許多企業都開始願意採用可分解材料來代替塑膠製品。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><br style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\" />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">:</span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">https://www.ettoday.net/news/20190626/1475462.htm</span></p>\n</div>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-06-27","clk_count":"211"}},"__N_SSG":true}